1
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,426
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,866
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,940
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,586
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,026
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,946
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,920
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,066
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,840
So Wanwei's death

10
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,840
wasn't from her car crash.

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,240
It was you!

12
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,320
I killed her.

13
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,200
That woman's dead.

14
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:06,040
You must be heartbroken.

15
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:08,079
You murderous psycho!

16
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,319
Lu Qiuliang,

17
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,799
what right do you have to judge me?

18
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,799
We're just as bad.

19
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,640
Too bad, though.

20
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:25,000
Lu Qiuliang,

21
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,599
you thought causing your brother's crash

22
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:27,959
would get her for you?

23
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,400
Keep dreaming!

24
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:31,480
She'd always be Lu Chengye's wife.

25
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,280
Your sister-in-law!

26
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:33,200
You lunatic!

27
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,680
Butler!

28
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,560
Get this crazy woman out of here.

29
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,319
She's never to set foot here again!

30
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:45,400
Get moving!

31
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:46,920
Let go of me!

32
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,519
Get moving!

33
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,400
Lu Qiuliang!

34
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:12,360
=Quite The Girl=

35
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,013
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

36
00:02:13,013 --> 00:02:13,493
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

37
00:02:13,493 --> 00:02:14,893
=Episode 23=

38
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:19,480
(Chen Wanwei)

39
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,360
Mom.

40
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:22,879
I'm here to see you.

41
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,120
I've avenged you.

42
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,960
But I can't bring myself to smile.

43
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:33,039
Du Wenxin was put in a mental hospital.

44
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:35,680
But that's nowhere
near enough punishment.

45
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,639
She caused your death.

46
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:42,280
Why is life so unfair?

47
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,560
Wanwei,

48
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,639
I brought your favorite lilies

49
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:53,360
to see you.

50
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,199
What right do you have to come here?

51
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,319
No one has more right than I do.

52
00:03:00,159 --> 00:03:02,599
In this family,
only I truly cared for her.

53
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,360
A killer's accomplice,
talking about caring?

54
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:07,680
You'll spend the rest of your life
atoning for what you did to my mother.

55
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,240
Look at you...

56
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:20,439
You look so much like your mother.

57
00:03:21,039 --> 00:03:22,199
Especially your eyes.

58
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:24,400
Yours are even prettier than hers.

59
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,120
When you look in the mirror,

60
00:03:26,879 --> 00:03:28,439
don't you feel disgusted with yourself?

61
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,159
I didn't hurt your mother.

62
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:36,039
I never meant to hurt her.

63
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,439
Don't blame me.

64
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,199
Okay?

65
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,400
You may not have meant to hurt her,

66
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,520
but you kept pressuring her to love you.

67
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:44,240
You even hurt your own brother!

68
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,000
You know that, right?

69
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,199
You need proof to make accusations!

70
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,520
Proof?

71
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:49,080
Listen to this!

72
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,800
(Too bad, Lu Qiuliang.)

73
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:53,520
(You thought
causing your brother's crash)

74
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,960
(would get her for you?)

75
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,120
(Keep dreaming!)

76
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:59,560
Want to hear the rest of my evidence?

77
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:01,360
What do you think would happen

78
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,319
if I posted this video online?

79
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,759
Those are just the words of a lunatic.

80
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,639
No one would believe them.

81
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,480
This family's success today

82
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,399
is all thanks

83
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:21,879
to your grandparents' hard work.

84
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:23,120
Are you really going

85
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,920
to turn your back on them, too?

86
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,199
You're threatening me
with Grandma again.

87
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:28,839
Listen,

88
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:30,519
I'm taking her away today.

89
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,800
If you try to stop me,

90
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,319
I'll release this video immediately.

91
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,959
We'll go down together.

92
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,519
Lu Mingyu,

93
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:42,040
after the scene you caused last night,

94
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,639
your grandma's condition
turned critical again.

95
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,560
I had her transferred overnight

96
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,079
to a better care home.

97
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,680
She'll get better care there.

98
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,399
If you won't back down

99
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,680
and ruin the Lu family's reputation,

100
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,199
her life will be on the line.

101
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,720
Fine.

102
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,279
If you're so determined to care for her,

103
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,000
you'll have to pay the price.

104
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,439
Mr. Wang.

105
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,879
Miss Lu.

106
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,480
You went to see Grandma, didn't you?

107
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:40,680
Miss Lu,

108
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,360
I don't know what you mean.

109
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,439
What's your yearly salary

110
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,560
with the Lu family?

111
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:47,879
What are you getting at?

112
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:50,360
Name your price.

113
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:51,759
How much would it take

114
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:54,079
for you to tell me where Grandma is?

115
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:56,680
Miss Lu,

116
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:58,639
without Mr. Lu's favor,

117
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,800
I'd never have gone from a repairman

118
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,879
to the Lu family's butler.

119
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,839
However much you offer,

120
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,600
I won't betray Mr. Lu.

121
00:06:15,746 --> 00:06:17,020
(Wang Bingkun Background Check Report)

122
00:06:20,079 --> 00:06:21,759
The butler has no children.

123
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:24,120
His only family contact is his mother,

124
00:06:24,279 --> 00:06:25,720
who's now bedridden and seriously ill.

125
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:27,600
She needs top-tier medical equipment
to survive.

126
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,120
And Lu Qiuliang is paying for it all.

127
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,120
Something doesn't add up.

128
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,160
Given her condition,

129
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:35,319
his mother doesn't have much time left.

130
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:38,600
Lu Qiuliang really has time
on his hands,

131
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,000
looking after two elders' lives.

132
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,000
He's so fond of using the elderly

133
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:44,800
to exploit others' weaknesses.

134
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,240
Such a bottomless pit.

135
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,639
Lu Qiuliang's really going all out.

136
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:05,079
Grandma left the Lu residence
this morning.

137
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:07,639
By the time you ran into Mr. Wang
on his return,

138
00:07:08,319 --> 00:07:09,439
the window was pretty short.

139
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,879
So he couldn't have

140
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:17,240
taken Grandma beyond this radius.

141
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:20,160
Xizi City has over 100 care homes.

142
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,519
We've ruled out half of them.

143
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,519
We only need to check
the remaining fifty.

144
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,360
Hello.

145
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,279
Is this Ren'ai Senior Care Center?

146
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:31,680
Hello.

147
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,399
Is this Kangyang Care Center?

148
00:07:33,426 --> 00:07:34,266
(Lu Family Ancestral Hall)

149
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,800
Is this Bo'ai Senior Care Center?

150
00:07:35,850 --> 00:07:36,266
(Lu Family Ancestral Hall)

151
00:07:36,319 --> 00:07:37,040
Hello.

152
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,439
Hello.

153
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,639
Hello.

154
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:41,839
Hello, is this Fulu Senior Care?

155
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,279
(Hello?)

156
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:30,000
(Is this Guangming Nursing Home?)

157
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,279
(I'd like to ask about someone.)

158
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:33,440
(Her name is Tao Yalan.)

159
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,360
(Yes, that's right.)

160
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:46,000
They're Dongchen's
customer service elite.

161
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,440
Their communication and screening skills

162
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,720
are the best in the business.

163
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,879
Leave the job to them.

164
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,360
But...

165
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,399
Your top priority now is to sleep.

166
00:08:53,799 --> 00:08:55,720
Powering down. Now.

167
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:18,000
That feels good.

168
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,240
That should do it.

169
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,440
Lying down this long and still awake?

170
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,320
Looks like you need a little help.

171
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,600
Eyes are essential for an artist.

172
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,240
How will you paint with blurry eyesight?

173
00:09:34,759 --> 00:09:35,559
Lu Mingye,

174
00:09:36,399 --> 00:09:37,600
you'd better remember this.

175
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:39,840
You don't have to be strong.

176
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,639
I've got your back.

177
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,919
What tune are you humming?

178
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,519
It's actually pretty soothing.

179
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,919
Last time at Grandma's,

180
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:07,519
I heard her humming this tune.

181
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:09,399
Maybe your grandma used

182
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:10,840
to sing you to sleep with it.

183
00:10:11,399 --> 00:10:13,320
I thought it might help you relax.

184
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,039
Looks like it works pretty well.

185
00:10:15,919 --> 00:10:17,519
Grandma's humming?

186
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,600
I don't remember her ever humming tunes.

187
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,039
How did I forget that?

188
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,799
Then humming tunes

189
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,639
might not have been her own habit.

190
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:33,080
Maybe she'd heard it
over and over somewhere

191
00:10:33,639 --> 00:10:34,440
without even realizing it.

192
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:39,759
Hum it again.

193
00:10:40,159 --> 00:10:41,440
As much as you can remember.

194
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,240
Found it!

195
00:10:55,559 --> 00:10:56,360
This one.

196
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:59,159
(Match found: Years of Peace)
They recently held

197
00:10:59,159 --> 00:11:01,879
a small charity music event
and healing workshop.

198
00:11:02,639 --> 00:11:03,960
It ran for three days straight.

199
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,919
Grandma's in this one.

200
00:11:48,650 --> 00:11:53,180
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

201
00:11:55,770 --> 00:11:59,343
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

202
00:12:02,730 --> 00:12:07,250
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

203
00:12:08,510 --> 00:12:13,410
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

204
00:12:16,050 --> 00:12:22,250
♪A love letter written in song♪

205
00:12:22,810 --> 00:12:27,503
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

206
00:12:30,130 --> 00:12:36,116
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

207
00:12:36,890 --> 00:12:42,463
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

208
00:12:43,350 --> 00:12:50,090
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

209
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:53,170
♪Close your eyes and count♪

210
00:12:53,450 --> 00:12:57,870
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

211
00:12:57,870 --> 00:13:02,070
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
